# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — explainer videos

Human index of the recorded walkthroughs. The videos themselves live in `videos/out/` (gitignored,
rebuilt on demand); what is versioned is `videos/config.json` and `videos/guiones/*.json`. The proof
that a row is current is `videos/out/manifest.json`, written by `explainer-record --verify`.

- Last verified: {{VERIFIED_DATE}}
- Voice: {{VOICE_LABEL}} (fallbacks only when the owner chooses them)
- Base URL: {{BASE_URL}} (a local stack; recordings never run against a deployed environment)
- Sign-in variables (names only): {{ENV_VAR_NAMES}}

