## Regenerate

1. Start the local stack: `{{START_STACK_COMMAND}}`.
2. Reset the demo data when a guion changes it: `{{RESET_DATA_COMMAND}}`.
3. Export the sign-in variables listed above in the shell that runs the recorder.
4. `explainer-record --doctor` must end in `DOCTOR: ready`.
5. `explainer-record <ids>` (or `--all`), about two minutes per video, then `explainer-record --verify <ids>`.
6. Update the rows above from the new `manifest.json` and the date at the top.

`--dry` runs the real actions without camera or voice and changes the local data: reset first.

